        S("A fixed policy is another average", "For Vπ, average the action values with the policy probabilities as well. Do not replace either average with a max.", root="Vπ(s)", values=(.2, .6, .4), weights=(.2, .5, .3), branch="Qπ", equation="Expectation: evaluate the policy you were given."),
